make a pun ugh","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T09:33:46-07:00","id":245388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/243676-abyssal-resistance?p=245355#post245355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As to the dev's comments, am I missing something, or are they basically saying, &quot;Yeah, Mirror charms were a wash, we're not doing that again...except when we are!&quot; I mean, Abyssal Charms being mechanically identical to Solar charms, but with darker imagery, is pretty much the very definition of Mirror Charm, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>In this context Mirror refers specifically to the Mirror Keyword and how its use was often &quot;see Exalted core page xx&quot; no denying that it saved on word count but it robbed Abyssals of a lot of their own unique identity.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","name":"Bastet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T09:38:30-07:00","id":245403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/243676-abyssal-resistance?p=245355#post245355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As to the dev's comments, am I missing something, or are they basically saying, &quot;Yeah, Mirror charms were a wash, we're not doing that again...except when we are!&quot; I mean, Abyssal Charms being mechanically identical to Solar charms, but with darker imagery, is pretty much the very definition of Mirror Charm, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Except that the original Mirror charms in Abyssal 1e were inverse of Solar charms rather than purely the exact same thing except in cases like Ox-body which were too functional and well written, but those were rare. it seems they are aiming for this in how they will be handeling mirror charms in 3e, inverted solar charms. An example would be A Solar charm would add die to the Solar's roll, an Abyssal would subtract from the opposing dice pool. A solar would reroll their 1's on an attack roll, an Abyssal would lower the pool the target's defense pool. A solar increases his soak makeing himself greater, an abyssal reduces the raw damage before it hits their soak, erroding their enemy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}